      "instance_name": "slaughter_scene",
      "label": "slaughter_scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting the slaughter of a cow, with blood pooling on the ground and a person's hands covered in blood, actively involved in the process. The cow is lying on its side on dirt ground, visibly injured and bleeding. The scene is overlaid with text that reads 'steak recipe: 1. destroy someone', creating a darkly humorous and shocking juxtaposition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
