      "instance_name": "shock",
      "label": "shocked emotion",
      "description": "The image evokes a strong sense of shock due to its graphic depiction of animal slaughter and the darkly humorous text overlay. The viewer is confronted with visceral imagery (blood, violence) juxtaposed with an absurd concept ('steak recipe'), creating a jarring and unsettling emotional response.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
