      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text '1. destroy someone' as the meme's dark humor and cynical message implicitly addresses the viewer by suggesting that obtaining desired things (like steak) requires destruction. The text acts as a direct address to the user, inviting them to consider the violent reality behind consumption.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
